/*************************************************************************
** The following three functions, found below:
**
**   rbuDeltaGetInt()
**   rbuDeltaChecksum()
**   rbuDeltaApply()
**
** are lifted from the fossil source code (http://fossil-scm.org). They
** are used to implement the scalar SQL function rbu_fossil_delta().
